1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,920
Now that sounds kind of maybe not real mainstream.
这样听起来也许不太主流。

2
00:00:04,920 --> 00:00:15,360
But if you had a if you had a friend if you had a person you're gonna sit down spend all the time with what would you want from that person what would you want.
但假如有一个朋友，一个要坐下来长时间相处的人，你希望从这个人身上得到什么？你会期待什么？

3
00:00:15,360 --> 00:00:22,370
Well I would want to spend time with somebody who's honest.
我希望和一个诚实的人相处。

4
00:00:22,380 --> 00:00:26,700
Makes sense I don't want to spend time with somebody who's going to be lying to me all the time.
这有道理吧。我不想和一个总是对我撒谎的人相处。

5
00:00:26,700 --> 00:00:35,750
Someone who's going to gently tell me the truth about myself.
我想要一个会温和地告诉我实情的人，让我了解真实的自己。

6
00:00:35,760 --> 00:00:42,349
One of the hardest things sometimes for the human to do is get to the point where they stop lying to themselves.
有时，人最难做到的事之一，就是不再对自己撒谎。

7
00:00:42,359 --> 00:00:46,140
Where they tell themselves the truth they speak the truth to themselves.
他们要向自己说真话，对自己坦诚。

8
00:00:46,140 --> 00:00:55,500
Now you got to face the reality of who you are you got to face the reality of what you are.
你必须面对真实的自己，面对自己到底是什么样的人。

9
00:00:55,980 --> 00:01:04,370
All right and and nobody's going to tell you that like you yourself will tell you that.
而且，没有人会像你自己一样，把这些告诉你。

10
00:01:04,380 --> 00:01:15,169
Um you want to tell yourself the truth but you want to tell yourself the truth in understanding and forgiveness.
你要对自己说真话，同时带着理解与宽容。

11
00:01:15,179 --> 00:01:21,530
I look back at things in my life and I can't say it was somebody else's fault.
回头看人生里的一些事情，我不能说那是别人的错。

12
00:01:21,540 --> 00:01:23,750
I can't say I didn't do that.
我也不能否认自己做过那些事。

13
00:01:23,760 --> 00:01:27,020
I can't say this is why I did that so that made it all right.
也不能说，因为某种原因才这样做，所以就没有问题了。

14
00:01:27,020 --> 00:01:30,410
I mean all the way back you know human our entire lives.
我是说，一直往回看，我们人这一整个生命历程都是如此。

15
00:01:30,420 --> 00:01:37,669
So I got to tell myself the truth yeah that was that was not okay.
所以，我得对自己说实话：是的，那样做不对。

16
00:01:37,679 --> 00:01:49,070
But then I at the same time I have to tell myself that uh you're a human and you made it right.
但同时我也得告诉自己：你是人，而且你已经作出了弥补。

17
00:01:49,080 --> 00:01:57,770
And you're making it right and it's okay it's okay.
你也正在弥补，没关系，可以了。

18
00:01:57,780 --> 00:02:09,780
Wherever you've been in the past that's bad if you're not still there your companion which is yourself needs to feel free to tell you it's okay.
无论过去曾处于多糟糕的状态，只要现在已经不在那里，你的伙伴，也就是你自己，就应当可以对你说：没关系了。

19
00:02:09,780 --> 00:02:13,140
That was a bad place to be that was a bad person to be.
那确实是糟糕的处境，那时的你也确实不好。

20
00:02:13,140 --> 00:02:16,680
But you're not that person anymore and you're not in that place anymore.
但你已经不是那个人，也不再处于那个处境。

21
00:02:17,160 --> 00:02:26,090
But if you're with yourself and yourself is always beating you up you're not going to want to be with yourself.
可如果你和自己相处时，总是不停责备自己，那你自然不会想和自己待着。

22
00:02:26,100 --> 00:02:32,160
If I'm sitting out here by myself in the evening buy a fire a cup of coffee and a cigar.
假如傍晚我独自坐在这里，在火边，喝杯咖啡、抽支雪茄——

23
00:02:32,160 --> 00:02:36,720
And I'm constantly beating myself up over my failures in the past.
却一直为了过去的失败不停责备自己。

24
00:02:36,720 --> 00:02:48,229
I'm not someone that I want to be alone with does it make sense all right.
那么，我就不是一个自己愿意独处相伴的人。这样说有道理吗？好。

25
00:02:48,239 --> 00:02:53,880
You got to make yourself and then the next thing I want I would want from a companion.
你要把自己变成那样的人；接下来，我会希望从一个伙伴身上得到的——

26
00:02:53,880 --> 00:02:55,859
Is I would want someone who is encouraging.
是一个会鼓励我的人。

27
00:02:55,859 --> 00:02:58,260
Who sees the possibility in the future.
他能看到未来的可能性。

28
00:02:58,260 --> 00:03:03,419
Who gently pushes me and encourages me to get out of the rut.
他会温和地推动我，鼓励我走出那种一成不变、停滞不前的状态。

29
00:03:03,419 --> 00:03:10,669
To get out of the hole to get out of the sheepfold to get out of the swamp that I'm in.
从坑里走出来，从羊圈里走出来，从身处的沼泽里走出来。

30
00:03:10,679 --> 00:03:12,480
And to move on and do better.
继续向前，做得更好。

31
00:03:12,480 --> 00:03:21,950
You want someone who's going to encourage you well if you don't have somebody who's going to do that become that somebody.
你想要一个会鼓励你的人。如果没有人会这样做，就成为那个鼓励自己的人。

32
00:03:21,960 --> 00:03:26,760
And again now I'm fellas I'm I'm blessed I mean I've got mama okay.
再说一次，朋友们，我很幸运，我有我口中的 mama，好吗。

33
00:03:26,760 --> 00:03:32,810
I'm not speaking um I've got something a lot of you guys don't I have mama.
我不是在……嗯，我拥有一些你们当中很多人没有的东西，我有 mama。

34
00:03:32,820 --> 00:03:39,779
But at the same time I have a a very comfortable relationship with myself.
但与此同时，我和自己的关系也非常自在。

35
00:03:41,760 --> 00:03:47,990
All right and sometimes if you don't have someone like mama yourself is what you have.
而有时，如果没有像 mama 那样的人陪着，你所拥有的就是你自己。

36
00:03:48,000 --> 00:03:49,560
And you need to encourage yourself.
你需要鼓励自己。

37
00:03:49,560 --> 00:03:53,580
You need to look around and you need to be able to encourage yourself and say.
你需要看看四周，能够给自己鼓励，并这样说——

38
00:03:53,580 --> 00:03:57,470
Look I'm not stuck here unless I choose to stay here.
听着，我并不是被困在这里，除非我选择继续留下。
